mulation. Use biometric ID and local proctors to administer testing.", "author": "2016TrumpMAGA", "created": 1789677346794, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "thehumbleme", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Get the Commies out of Education", "last_comment_created": 1789682289759, "content": "<p>We need to get the commies out of education.</p>\n<p>Our current higher education system is irretrievably broken. It is nothing but an indoctrination system that drains parents' life savings and enslaves students in debt.</p>\n<p>The only viable answer is a parallel education system that will eventually wipe out the status quo.</p>\n<p>Distance education can be delivered at extremely low cost. I'm thinking $10/credit hour. Students can proceed at their own pace, on their own schedule. There is no longer any lab process that cannot be done, and done more safely, through computer simulation. Use biometric ID and local proctors to administer testing.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 3, "score_up": 25, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2099843094552174862", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVM8JPxX", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 29, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8841457, "raw_content": "", "author": "nufosmatic", "created": 1789675007848, "profile_picture": "PiN9pDmgR3ja", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Aisle-is